1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:04,884
Form Studio is where you build and fix the
EMR's clinical forms in the browser,

2
00:00:04,884 --> 00:00:06,167
without writing code.

3
00:00:06,167 --> 00:00:08,122
This guide shows the main steps.

4
00:00:08,629 --> 00:00:11,525
Open it from the app menu at the top right.

5
00:00:11,525 --> 00:00:12,805
Choose Form Studio.

6
00:00:19,174 --> 00:00:21,224
The start page has two halves.

7
00:00:21,224 --> 00:00:24,368
On the left are three ways to make a new form:

8
00:00:24,368 --> 00:00:28,606
from scratch, from a Bahmni export,
or from an Excel template.

9
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:33,713
On the right is the table of all three
hundred forms in this EMR.

10
00:00:33,713 --> 00:00:36,261
Type in the search box to narrow it.

11
00:00:36,261 --> 00:00:37,464
Here, gynecology.

12
00:00:37,974 --> 00:00:42,502
Press Edit schema on Emergency
Triage Form, Gynecology.

13
00:00:42,502 --> 00:00:43,902
The editor opens.

14
00:00:44,405 --> 00:00:46,256
On the left are three views:

15
00:00:46,256 --> 00:00:49,364
Preview and edit, Rules, and
the Schema editor.

16
00:00:49,364 --> 00:00:54,653
On the right are the live form preview and a
panel for the checks and downloads.

17
00:00:55,166 --> 00:01:00,208
Every page, section and question has a pencil
to edit it and a bin to delete it.

18
00:01:00,208 --> 00:01:02,918
Press the pencil on a section to rename it.

19
00:01:03,430 --> 00:01:07,846
The new name shows in the form straight
away, and in the form's JSON.

20
00:01:14,177 --> 00:01:16,805
To add a question, press Add question.

21
00:01:16,805 --> 00:01:21,161
Give it a label, an ID and a type,
then search for its concept.

22
00:01:27,221 --> 00:01:30,372
Concepts are listed with the best match first.

23
00:01:30,372 --> 00:01:31,605
Pick one and save.

24
00:01:31,605 --> 00:01:33,797
The new question is in the form.

25
00:01:35,021 --> 00:01:35,837
Now a rule.

26
00:01:35,837 --> 00:01:40,588
The question PV should appear only
when Vaginal Bleeding is Yes.

27
00:01:40,588 --> 00:01:42,221
Open the rules for PV.

28
00:01:42,726 --> 00:01:44,074
Choose Only when.

29
00:01:44,074 --> 00:01:47,406
Pick Vaginal Bleeding, tick Yes, and save.

30
00:01:49,485 --> 00:01:52,675
The rule is written under PV as
a plain sentence.

31
00:01:52,675 --> 00:01:54,693
There is no expression to type.

32
00:01:55,199 --> 00:01:56,895
The preview obeys it.

33
00:01:56,895 --> 00:01:57,946
PV is hidden.

34
00:01:57,946 --> 00:02:01,823
Choose Yes for Vaginal
Bleeding, and PV appears.

35
00:02:02,328 --> 00:02:06,795
Before a form leaves Form Studio, press
Check concepts on the server.

36
00:02:06,795 --> 00:02:09,384
It looks up every concept the form uses.

37
00:02:09,895 --> 00:02:10,765
Zero errors.

38
00:02:10,765 --> 00:02:13,519
Download content files is now enabled.

39
00:02:13,519 --> 00:02:16,999
It gives a zip with the form
and a short README.

40
00:02:17,511 --> 00:02:21,409
Back on the start page, a new form
from an Excel template.

41
00:02:21,409 --> 00:02:25,105
You can download an empty template
or a filled example.

42
00:02:25,105 --> 00:02:26,919
Here we upload the example.

43
00:02:27,428 --> 00:02:32,024
Form Studio reads the sheet and matches
its concepts on the server.

44
00:02:32,024 --> 00:02:36,620
Nine pages, twenty-three sections, one
hundred and sixty questions.

45
00:02:37,132 --> 00:02:39,936
Open it in the editor and run the Check.

46
00:02:39,936 --> 00:02:43,300
Forty-four errors, under Must
fix before export.

47
00:02:46,612 --> 00:02:50,262
Each one is a question whose concept
still has to be picked.

48
00:02:50,262 --> 00:02:54,094
Pick it with the question's pencil, or
use Create new concepts.

49
00:02:54,094 --> 00:02:57,196
The download stays blocked until
the list is empty.

50
00:02:57,745 --> 00:02:59,901
Last, the concept dictionary.

51
00:02:59,901 --> 00:03:03,841
It holds every concept read from
this EMR's database.

52
00:03:04,356 --> 00:03:06,287
Search weight, in kilograms.

53
00:03:06,287 --> 00:03:12,012
Weight first, with its synonyms, its datatype,
and the number of forms that use it.

54
00:03:15,499 --> 00:03:20,826
Open the row to see its names, answers and
mappings, and the list of forms that use

55
00:03:20,826 --> 00:03:21,019
it.

56
00:03:22,837 --> 00:03:23,739
Form Studio:

57
00:03:23,739 --> 00:03:29,605
edit forms, write rules in plain words, and
check every concept before export.

